<title>USA: NYC to sell $200 mln GOs competitively on June 3.</title>
<headline>NYC to sell $200 mln GOs competitively on June 3.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York City announced that it plans to sell $200 million of general obligation bonds through competitive auction on June 3 at 1000 EDT.</p>
<p>The bonds will be dated date of delivery on or about June 10, 1997. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
